TITLE Calculate Thenardite SI with mg/L
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 8.0
    units mg/L
    density 1.0
    Ca 50
    Mg 12
    Na 20
    K 2
    Alkalinity 150
    S(6) 40
    Cl 15
END

USE solution 1
REACTION 1
    H2O -1
    50.0 moles
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Halite 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file solution_mgl.sel
    -si Thenardite
END
